ata Processing  Apps affected: Several apps where user group information is displayed.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Finance\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-09\nValid as Of: 2025-06-22\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 612 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Launchpad\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: New models are supported, including Nova Premier from AWS Bedrock.For more information, see SAP Note 3437766 .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-21\nValid as Of: 2025-06-21\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 613 ---\nComponent: SAP Translation Hub\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle:   Support for LLM-based translation in Software Translation  \nDescription:   Software translation workflow and editor: File and git projects now support LLM-based translation as additional translation provider, using Large Language Models via SAP's generative AI hub  APIs: LLM-based translation support was also added to the Translate API (synchronous) and the following project APIs: file project and git project API.  \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-18\nValid as Of: 2025-06-20\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 614 ---\nComponent: Application Frontend Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Availability in the SAP BTP Trial\nDescription: Application Frontend is available in the cf-us10- region of the SAP BTP trial.  Trial accounts are limited to five applications per subaccount.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-06-23\nValid as Of: 2025-06-19\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 615 ---\nComponent: Cloud Integration\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Shopify Receiver Adapter Available\nDescription: Shopify receiver adapter is available now. It facilitates connectivity with Shopify 